  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.1.0: no public API change. This is the release that introduces the LinKit.Engine.Monolith and LinKit.Engine.Microservice bundles and the LINKITENGINE001 build guard; Core is republished at 4.1.0 only so that a bundle version always names a Core version from the same release. v4.0.1: documentation and packaging patch - every public member now carries XML documentation (CS1591 is enforced as a build error) and the README was reviewed for accuracy. Previous release: v4.0.0 (breaking) - the metadata-only policy attributes were removed because they advertised behavior the framework never provided. [CacheAside]/[InvalidateCache] (LinKit.Core.Caching) and [Retry]/[CircuitBreaker]/[Timeout] (LinKit.Core.Resilience) are gone; use ICacheProvider from LinKit.Caching and ResiliencePipeline from LinKit.Resilience instead. BackoffType and CircuitBreakerOpenException stay. Diagnostic LKM003 was removed with them. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
